## Examples (MOST IMPORTANT)
- examples/datagen/self_improving_cot/self_improving_cot_example.py
  - Shows usage of SelfImprovingCoTPipeline with generator and verifier agents
  - Uses ChatAgent for reason_agent and evaluate_agent
  - Demonstrates loading problems, running pipeline, and saving results

## Implementation
- camel/datagen/cot_datagen.py
  - Classes: CoTDataGenerator, AgentResponse, VerificationResponse
  - Implements a Chain of Thought data generation tool with generator and verifier agents
  - Supports single-agent and dual-agent modes
  - Methods for generating answers, verifying, evaluating partial solutions, binary search error detection, and solving
  - Manages solution tree and golden answers

- camel/datagen/self_improving_cot.py
  - Classes: SelfImprovingCoTPipeline, ProblemResult, TraceIteration, AgentTraceEvaluation, RewardTraceEvaluation
  - Implements a self-improving CoT pipeline with reasoning trace generation, evaluation, feedback, and iterative improvement
  - Uses ChatAgent for reason_agent and evaluate_agent
  - Supports reward model evaluation and batch processing

- camel/agents/chat_agent.py
  - Class: ChatAgent (inherits BaseAgent)
  - Core chat agent implementation managing conversation, memory, tools, and model backends
  - Supports tool integration, memory management, summarization, and streaming responses

- camel/toolkits/sympy_toolkit.py
  - Class: SymPyToolkit (inherits BaseToolkit)
  - Provides symbolic computation tools using sympy (e.g., solve_equation)
  - Exposes many math-related functions as FunctionTool for agent use

## Tests
- test/datagen/test_self_improving_cot_pipeline.py
  - Unit tests for SelfImprovingCoTPipeline
  - Tests initialization, reasoning trace generation, evaluation, improvement, problem processing, and batch processing
  - Uses unittest and mocks ChatAgent and reward models

## Summary
For creating an agent with CoT data generation tool with generator and verifier agents to solve '2x^2-5x-3=0' and verify with sympy-computed gold answer, the most relevant files are:

- camel/datagen/cot_datagen.py (main CoT data generation tool with generator and verifier agents)
- examples/datagen/self_improving_cot/self_improving_cot_example.py (example usage of CoT pipeline with generator and verifier agents)
- camel/toolkits/sympy_toolkit.py (for sympy-based equation solving tool integration)
- camel/agents/chat_agent.py (core agent implementation)
- test/datagen/test_self_improving_cot_pipeline.py (tests for CoT pipeline)

These files provide the implementation, usage patterns, and testing references needed to create the requested agent script.
